// Text field selectionWatcher stream (section 5)
// Author: not credited on the listing page
// Source: VPRI TR-2012-001 (STEPS 2012 final report), Appendix II (Making Applications in KSWorld), section 5 Example: A Panel for the Tool Bar, lead-in 'Then we add the following stream', PDF page 45 (printed page 44)
// Transcribed from the page images; text-layer differences noted below.

selectionWatcher <-
  when
    DocEditor.selectedDocBox :b
  then
    this.textContents(if b then b.printString() else "")

// Transcription notes
// - Text layer vs image: no glyph differences found in this listing.
// - Spacing: indentation and alignment come from glyph positions, checked against the page image.
// - Uncertain glyphs: none.
